app target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"code":"LogHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Traffic logging","anchor":"Traffic-logging","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit to be compiled with "},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include